# Locale Cheat Sheet

A quick reference for every locale-exclusive generator function, grouped by locale. These are
country-specific formats that don't fit a shared `:locale` option, for example a US Social
Security Number has no Indonesian equivalent to fall back to. See
[Supported Locales](locales.html#locale-exclusive-generators) for background. For the
general-purpose domain generators (Address, Person, Blood, and so on), see the
[Cheat Sheet](cheat.html).

## English (US) - Default

{: .col-2}

### [`NeoFaker.Locales.EnUs.Person.ssn()`](`NeoFaker.Locales.EnUs.Person.ssn/0`)

```elixir
iex> NeoFaker.Locales.EnUs.Person.ssn()
"184-63-2006"
```

## Indonesian

{: .col-2}

### [`NeoFaker.Locales.IdId.Person.nik()`](`NeoFaker.Locales.IdId.Person.nik/0`)

```elixir
iex> NeoFaker.Locales.IdId.Person.nik()
"7645504903500640"
```

